+Refuel AI Supplements V6.4.63 — floating WhatsApp contact
+
+A customer support WhatsApp button sits above the AI launcher on the homepage, above the PWA bottom navigation, and at the lower right of WooCommerce product and shop pages. It hides while dialogs or the comparison tray are open and does not cover checkout. The button appears only when a valid business number is saved in Appearance → Customize → Refuel Customer Care → WhatsApp business number. Enter the international number with country code, such as 923001234567; do not enter an example number unless it belongs to your business. The link opens WhatsApp in a new tab with a short product-help greeting. The previous V6.4.62 changes are included.
